# Twins in the Loop

- Single Astro 7 app with Tailwind 4. Bun is the package manager. Do not add Turborepo.
- Pages stay thin composers (about 50 lines). New UI goes in `src/components/**` first.
- Reuse `Button`, `Chip`, `Logo`, `AuthorTag`, `Icon`, and `ArticleRow` instead of duplicating markup.
- Figma is the visual source of truth. Map colors and type into `src/styles/global.css` `@theme`.
- Semantic HTML and accessible nav/filters. No inline imports.
- Exhaustive `switch` on `type` / `author` unions with a `never` default.
- Do not hardcode page copy in `.astro` files. Copy lives in MDX collections.
- Reusable helpers belong in `src/lib/*.ts` with colocated `*.test.ts`, not in `.astro` frontmatter.
- Optimize local images with Astro `<Image>` and `src/lib/images.ts`.
